1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Before expanding an AI workflow, make one
unfinished task reviewable.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Start by reading its latest receipt and
checking for active work.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Choose a draft-only outcome. Name the
starting source revision, the

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,000
permitted action and the intended
destination before preparing a change.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Retrieve just the context that task needs.
Use synthetic details for a

6
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:30,000
first exercise, and keep unrelated private
conversations outside the bundle.

7
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Define one acceptance check. Keep the
artifact, the checks

8
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:40,000
actually performed and the remaining gap
together for review.

9
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:45,000
If execution is blocked, retain the
checkpoint. A prepared handoff

10
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:50,000
does not authorize retries, purchases,
publication or deployment.

11
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:55,000
Ask the owner to review the exact result
before release. Which existing

12
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:00,000
task could you reduce to one artifact and
one meaningful check?
